flowchart TD
    Load["Browser loads DevUI from AGC"]
    Api["DevUI JavaScript calls a protected API"]
    OAuth["OAuth2 Proxy checks the session cookie"]
    Entra["Microsoft Entra ID sign-in and callback"]
    Start["User submits topic"]
    Browser["DevUI JavaScript creates workflow and task IDs"]
    ResearchCall["Browser calls research through AGC, OAuth2 Proxy, BFF, and APIM"]
    Discover["Research discovers and ranks sources"]
    Group["Group URLs by domain with maximum five groups"]
    Create["Broker creates sandboxes in parallel"]
    Policy["Apply default deny egress policies"]
    Fetch["Fetch approved source domains"]
    Egress["Collect egress decisions"]
    Retain["Retain completed sandboxes for portal visibility"]
    Brief["Research brief returns through APIM and BFF to DevUI"]
    Fanout["DevUI fans out the same brief through BFF and APIM"]
    CreateContent["Creator generates blog and social content"]
    Podcast["Podcaster generates script and audio"]
    Persist["Persist audio to private Blob Storage"]
    Complete["DevUI displays completed workflow"]
    Cleanup["Delete retained sandboxes asynchronously"]
    Telemetry["Correlated telemetry in Application Insights"]

    Load --> Api
    Api --> OAuth
    OAuth -->|"no valid session"| Entra
    Entra -->|"callback and session cookie"| OAuth
    OAuth -->|"authenticated API"| Start
    Start --> Browser
    Browser --> ResearchCall
    ResearchCall --> Discover
    Discover --> Group
    Group --> Create
    Create --> Policy
    Policy --> Fetch
    Fetch --> Egress
    Egress --> Retain
    Retain --> Brief
    Brief --> Fanout
    Fanout -->|"synchronous A2A"| CreateContent
    Fanout -->|"asynchronous A2A and polling"| Podcast
    Podcast --> Persist
    CreateContent --> Complete
    Persist --> Complete
    Retain -.-> Cleanup
    ResearchCall -.-> Telemetry
    Discover -.-> Telemetry
    Create -.-> Telemetry
    CreateContent -.-> Telemetry
    Podcast -.-> Telemetry
